  "project_description": "This module uses the dhtmlx GANTT javascript library\n\nBy default it uses the cdn but you can buy the PRO version and put it in /libraries/gantt/codebase/\n\n If you are not a drupal expert, you can install the Gantt Node demo and use it.\n\nit basically creates a Node Gantt content and a Ganttt view. Once installed, you can go to /gantt (For the first time go to /node/add/gantt to create a new task). After creating, the interface will be displayed to get started\n\n \n\nif you like version paragraphs you can try module with paragraphs gantt \n\nit have same functionality\n\n Do you like this module? Show your appreciation by buying me ☕ .",
